    {
      "claim_id": "c3",
      "status": "supported",
      "witness": null,
      "reason": "The claim correctly states that EXT_SOURCE_1 (contribution: -0.4836), bureau_sum (contribution: -0.4721), and bureau_debt (contribution: -0.3226) all decrease risk, matching their documented directions. The values cited (0.409, 14,845.5, 0.0) are the observed facts, not attributions — and the claim does not falsely attribute direction to them; it correctly says these factors 'lower risk' by referencing their model-driven effects. No R_FACT_AS_DRIVER violation occurs because the claim does not say the fact itself lowers risk — it says the factors (which have attributions) do. All statements are consistent with evidence."
